WEBVTT

00:10:29.583 --> 00:10:32.586
that they had when they ate
one of our desserts.

00:10:33.337 --> 00:10:37.716
I chose to put women
at the helm of my organization.

00:10:37.716 --> 00:10:40.594
Because when I looked
around the hospitality industry,

00:10:40.594 --> 00:10:45.099
people running operations,
folks holding CEO titles,

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:46.433
they were all men.

00:10:47.142 --> 00:10:48.394
I mean, why?

00:10:48.435 --> 00:10:52.940
I was raised by these fierce matriarchs
who handled business,

00:10:52.981 --> 00:10:55.401
and I wanted my organization
to look like that.

00:10:55.442 --> 00:10:59.154
I want to show the world
what women were capable of

00:10:59.154 --> 00:11:01.156
and what a "bakery" could be.